{"text":"kuruntokai","n":63,"lines":["ஈதலும் துய்த்தலும் இல்லோர்க் கில்லெனச்","செய்வினை கைம்மிக எண்ணுதி அவ்வினைக்கு","அம்மா அரிவையும் வருமோ","எம்மை உய்த்தியோ உரைத்திசின் நெஞ்சே"],"tr":["ītalum tuyttalum illōrk killeṉac","ceyviṉai kaimmika eṇṇuti avviṉaikku","ammā arivaiyum varumō","emmai uyttiyō uraitticiṉ neñcē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"உகாய்க்குடிகிழார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Ukāykkuṭikiḻār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 13, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 9, āciriyattaḷai 4, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஈதலும்","tr":"ītalum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஈ","tr":"ī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலும்","tr":"talum"}]},{"text":"துய்த்தலும்","tr":"tuyttalum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"துய்த்","tr":"tuyt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலும்","tr":"talum"}]},{"text":"இல்லோர்க்","tr":"illōrk","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இல்","tr":"il"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோர்க்","tr":"lōrk"}]},{"text":"கில்லெனச்","tr":"killeṉac","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கில்","tr":"kil"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லெனச்","tr":"leṉac"}]}],[{"text":"செய்வினை","tr":"ceyviṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வினை","tr":"viṉai"}]},{"text":"கைம்மிக","tr":"kaimmika","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கைம்","tr":"kaim"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிக","tr":"mika"}]},{"text":"எண்ணுதி","tr":"eṇṇuti","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"எண்","tr":"eṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணுதி","tr":"ṇuti"}]},{"text":"அவ்வினைக்கு","tr":"avviṉaikku","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அவ்","tr":"av"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வினைக்","tr":"viṉaik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"அம்மா","tr":"ammā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"}]},{"text":"அரிவையும்","tr":"arivaiyum","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரி","tr":"ari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"வருமோ","tr":"varumō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வரு","tr":"varu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மோ","tr":"mō"}]}],[{"text":"எம்மை","tr":"emmai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"எம்","tr":"em"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மை","tr":"mai"}]},{"text":"உய்த்தியோ","tr":"uyttiyō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"உய்த்","tr":"uyt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தியோ","tr":"tiyō"}]},{"text":"உரைத்திசின்","tr":"uraitticiṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உரைத்","tr":"urait"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திசின்","tr":"ticiṉ"}]},{"text":"நெஞ்சே","tr":"neñcē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெஞ்","tr":"neñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சே","tr":"cē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஈதலும்","parts":[{"text":"ஈதல்","lemma":"ītal","gloss":"giving"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and giving"},{"surface":"துய்த்தலும்","parts":[{"text":"துய்த்தல்","lemma":"tuyttal","gloss":"enjoying"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and enjoying"},{"surface":"இல்லோர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"not having"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ōr","gloss":"those who"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"kku","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to those who do not have"},{"surface":"இல்லென","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"not existing"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"saying that"}],"gloss":"saying that they do not exist"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செய்வினை","parts":[{"text":"செய்","lemma":"cey","gloss":"do"},{"text":"வினை","lemma":"viṉai","gloss":"work"}],"gloss":"the work to be done"},{"surface":"கைம்மிக","parts":[{"text":"கைம்மிக","lemma":"கைம்மிக","gloss":"to exceed greatly"}],"gloss":"to exceed greatly","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"எண்ணுதி","parts":[{"text":"எண்ணு","lemma":"eṇṇu","gloss":"think"},{"text":"தி","lemma":"ti","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"you think"},{"surface":"அவ்வினைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"அவ்வினைக்கு","lemma":"அவ்வினைக்கு","gloss":"for that work"}],"gloss":"for that work","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அம்மா","parts":[{"text":"அம்மா","lemma":"ammā","gloss":"alas"}],"gloss":"alas"},{"surface":"அரிவையும்","parts":[{"text":"அரிவை","lemma":"arivai","gloss":"young woman"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"the young woman also"},{"surface":"வருமோ","parts":[{"text":"வரு","lemma":"varu","gloss":"come"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"will"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"question particle"}],"gloss":"will she come?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எம்மை","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"em","gloss":"me"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ai","gloss":"accusative marker"}],"gloss":"me"},{"surface":"உய்த்தியோ","parts":[{"text":"உய்த்து","lemma":"uyttu","gloss":"lead"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"you"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"question particle"}],"gloss":"will you take?"},{"surface":"உரைத்திசின்","parts":[{"text":"உரை","lemma":"urai","gloss":"tell"},{"text":"தி","lemma":"ti","gloss":"you"},{"text":"சின்","lemma":"ciṉ","gloss":"particle of request"}],"gloss":"please tell"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"neñcu","gloss":"heart"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"vocative particle"}],"gloss":"O heart!"}]}],"literal":"And giving and enjoying, to those who do not have, saying they do not exist / the work to be done, to exceed greatly, you think; for that work / alas, the young woman also, will she come? / me, will you take? Please tell, O heart!","translation":"Thinking that giving to others and enjoying life are impossible for those without wealth, you plan to go and perform a task that exceeds all limits. O heart, tell me: will my beautiful young woman also come with us for that task, or will you take only me?","modern":"பிறருக்குக் கொடுப்பதும் நாம் அனுபவிப்பதும் செல்வம் இல்லாதவர்களுக்கு இல்லை என்று எண்ணி, பொருள் ஈட்டும் செயலை எல்லை கடந்து செய்ய நினைக்கிறாய். என் நெஞ்சமே! அந்தச் செயலைச் செய்ய என் அழகிய தலைவியும் வருவாளா? அல்லது என்னை மட்டும் அழைத்துச் செல்வாயா? எனக்குச் சொல்வாயாக.","explanation":"The hero is speaking to his own heart in the context of Pālai tiṇai (separation). He is torn between his duty to earn wealth and his love for his lady. His heart urges him to leave for a distant land to acquire wealth, arguing that without money, one can neither practice charity nor enjoy life's pleasures. However, the hero hesitates, knowing the journey through the harsh desert is too difficult for his delicate beloved. He questions his heart, asking if the young woman will accompany them or if the heart intends to drag him away alone, highlighting his deep inner conflict.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}